{
  "id": "u13-l06",
  "unit": "u13-requests",
  "title": "The line got cut",
  "status": "draft",
  "tip": "**When the phone lets you down:**\n\n- **লাইন কেটে গেছে** 'The line got cut' (কাটা 'cut' + গেছে 'has gone'); learn it as one chunk.\n- **সে ফোন ধরছে না** 'He isn't picking up' (ধরা 'hold, catch').\n- **আমার ফোনে চার্জ নেই** 'My phone has no charge'. **ফোনে** = ফোন + -এ 'on the phone'.\n- **লাইন ব্যস্ত** 'The line is busy'.\n\nAsk the other person to **একটু জোরে বলুন** 'speak up a little' (the opposite of **আস্তে**) or **পরে ফোন করুন** 'call later'.\n\nIn Bangladesh people also say **ফোন দেওয়া** for 'to call': **পরে ফোন দেব** 'I'll call later'.",
  "vocab": [
    {
      "id": "lain",
      "bn": "লাইন",
      "tr": "lain",
      "en": "line"
    },
    {
      "id": "kete-gechhe",
